        "url": "https://bretcontreras.com/wp-content/uploads/An-electromyographic-comparison-of-a-modified-version-of-the-plank-with-a-long-lever-and-posterior-tilt-versus-the-traditional-plank-exercise.pdf"
      },
      {
        "id": "escamilla2006",
